        "QuestionText_Unsafe": "Thank you for participating! Your responses have been recorded.<br>\n<br>\nPlease click the 'End Task' button below to return to Prolific and confirm your completion.<br>\n<br>\n<strong>Do not close this window or use the back button</strong> \u2014 your submission is only finalized once you are redirected to Prolific.",
